<div class="flex_column av-friexo-e96df2fe4580187b15205753733acf6a av_one_full avia-builder-el-20 el_after_av_one_third el_before_av_one_full first flex_column_div column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-m895t6cj-3ad0ce725caf8f591a3f553469885d5b av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-21 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first"><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Professional Journey and Achievements</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m895tx0d-a2b745b6ed50ae3253fd41979ed9ccfe" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p><img alt="Dr. Bankole Johnson, founder of Casa Privee and considered one of the best concierge doctors in Miami." class="alignright wp-image-1437" decoding="async" height="233" sizes="(max-width: 250px) 100vw, 250px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/drbankolejohnson-495x400.jpg" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/drbankolejohnson-300x280.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/drbankolejohnson-768x717.jpg 768w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/drbankolejohnson-705x658.jpg 705w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/drbankolejohnson.jpg 955w" width="250"/>Dr. Johnson’s professional journey has included significant leadership roles and awards:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Current Roles:</strong> <a href="about-us.php">Founder, Executive Chairman, and CEO</a> at <a href="/">Privée Clinics</a> (Miami, Florida), and Founder and Chief Medical Officer at Adial Pharmaceuticals, Inc.</li>
<li><strong>University of Maryland</strong> <strong>(2013–2019)</strong>: Chair of Psychiatry, leader of the Brain Science Research Consortium, and Professor of Anatomy and Neuroscience, Pharmacology, Neurology, Medicine, and Psychiatry.</li>
<li><strong>University of Virginia (2004–2013)</strong>: Psychiatry and Neurobehavioral Sciences Chairman.</li>
<li><strong>University of Texas Health Science Center</strong> <strong>(1993–2004)</strong>: Chief of the Division of Alcohol and <a href="drug-addiction-rehabilitation.php">Drug Addiction</a> and director of significant research initiatives.</li>
<li><b><strong class="font-bold">Dan Anderson Research Award (2001):</strong></b> Recognizing his outstanding contributions to addiction research.</li>
<li><b><strong class="font-bold">Adolf Meyer Research Award (2003):</strong></b> One of the highest honors in American psychiatry.</li>
<li><b><strong class="font-bold">Solomon Carter Fuller Award (2009):</strong></b> Celebrating his role as a leading African-American scientist and psychiatrist.</li>
<li><b><strong class="font-bold">R. Brinkley Smithers Distinguished Scientist Award (2019):</strong></b> Honoring his dedication to advancing the understanding and treatment of addiction.</li>
</ul>
<p>His leadership has resulted in some of the most impactful research, especially in addiction medicine, neuroimaging, and treatment development for substance dependencies.</p>
<p>Additionally, he holds over 100 global patents in neuroscience and molecular genetics, underscoring his innovative impact on medical science.</p>
</div></section></div>
<div class="flex_column av-dw92q4-41fb6a4c37bd7d796c938ce473ffd20d av_one_full avia-builder-el-23 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_full first flex_column_div column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-m895uiqw-fb9457e969e11809094d8f9749069e67 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-24 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first"><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Memberships and Affiliations </h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m895vj5j-85f263f622e8957ebd4790008e794c48" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p>Dr. Johnson’s professional influence spans numerous organizations in medicine, science, and psychopharmacology:</p>
<ul>
<li>Fellow of the <strong>Royal Society of Medicine</strong></li>
<li>Fellow of the <strong>American College of Neuropsychopharmacology</strong>.</li>
<li>Lifetime Member of the <strong>American Board of Disability Analysts</strong>.</li>
<li>Distinguished Fellow of the <strong>American Psychiatric Association</strong>.</li>
</ul>
<p>He has also contributed to several advisory boards, including:</p>
<ul>
<li>The <strong>National Institute of Health (NIH)</strong></li>
<li>The <strong>National Institute of Drug Abuse (NIDA)</strong></li>
</ul>
<p>His global collaborations have expanded the understanding of addiction and mental health.</p>
</div></section></div>
<div class="flex_column av-ctqbvw-1385e0efaa9c20d7e30897dc56f6c59e av_one_full avia-builder-el-26 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_full first flex_column_div column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-m89awuz2-6aa9687dbf4f566317e7ff59fe898f5d av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-27 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first"><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Unique Approach To Medicine</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m89ax0ky-bf1252e4f91e27aefdb086c80609da0f" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p data-wp-editing="1"><img alt="Glass tubes being filled with testing solutions to assist in determining the proper course of treatment for a patient's customized treatment program." class="alignright wp-image-1457" decoding="async" height="200" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/casa-privee-medical-testing.jpg" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/casa-privee-medical-testing.jpg 1024w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/casa-privee-medical-testing-300x200.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/casa-privee-medical-testing-768x512.jpg 768w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/casa-privee-medical-testing-705x470.jpg 705w" width="300"/>Dr. Johnson uniquely combines basic and translational science, creating a profound impact on clinical outcomes. His innovative approach bridges the gap between laboratory research and real-world medical applications, enabling him to translate complex scientific discoveries into practical, life-changing improvements in <a href="treatment-programs.php">patient care</a>. By focusing on both the foundational science and its application in clinical settings, he has significantly influenced not only treatment methodologies but also the overall standard of care, paving the way for more effective and <a href="treatment-programs.php">personalized medical solutions</a>. His work exemplifies the critical role of integrating research and practice to address pressing healthcare challenges.</p>
</div></section></div>
<div class="flex_column av-also7g-550a1e2754db35522097eb4ba726ba3b av_one_full avia-builder-el-29 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_full first flex_column_div column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-m895vsr6-75a65bfec0d1d4105030acfed6a6eb05 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-30 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first"><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Publications and Media Presence</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m896fhrm-ccee9034f45fced7d6d65cdcdb6b17ac" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p>Dr. Johnson has authored over 300 peer-reviewed publications and six books, including <strong>Addiction Medicine: Science and Practice</strong>, which is regarded as a definitive resource in the field. Beyond academia, he has been featured in major media outlets, including <strong>The New York Times</strong>, <strong>CNN</strong>, <strong>The Lancet</strong>, and the Emmy-winning HBO documentary, <strong>Addiction</strong>.</p>
<p>In addition, Dr. Johnson founded the <a href="podcasts.php">Casa Privee Podcast</a>, which covers topics such as neuropsychology, <a href="depression-treatment.php">depression</a>, and emerging innovative <a href="drug-addiction-rehabilitation.php">drug treatments</a>.</p>
</div></section></div>
<div class="flex_column av-989me4-11a352f27e811e859d21f6d621b7f18c av_one_full avia-builder-el-32 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_full first flex_column_div column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-m89as2s6-7c91d82f70b06337f30ff35f592f220f av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-33 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first"><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Founding Casa Privée Concierge Medicine</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m89asao2-08a1b518bac7c5bdaead14f4bf5b7ead" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p>Dr. Johnson’s latest endeavor, <a href="/">Casa Privée</a>, represents the synthesis of his life’s work. His addiction clinic in Miami champions <a href="treatment-programs.php">holistic, preventive, and brain medicine</a>, addressing the full spectrum of patient needs from <a href="neurostar-tms-therapy.php">brain health</a> to beauty and wellness. At <a href="/">Casa Privée,</a> patients benefit from innovations such as <a href="hyperbaric-oxygen-therapy-hbot.php">hyperbaric oxygen therapy</a>, DNA-based precision medicine, and advanced wellness treatments led by Dr. Johnson himself.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="flex_column av-2xfgws-d4545baea75fb4bfb54feb2e6722965d av_one_full avia-builder-el-35 el_after_av_one_full avia-builder-el-last first flex_column_div column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-m89atb3u-994ccecc268edece937d11c3816d3220 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-36 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first"><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">The Legacy of Excellence</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m89at73z-b6b2c63b22be7ad3a1baecdba2e64db7" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p>Dr. Bankole A. Johnson exemplifies true dedication to medicine, applying unparalleled expertise and groundbreaking innovation to transform lives. Through his relentless pursuit of excellence, he has shaped the fields of addiction medicine, neuropsychiatric, and brain care, solidifying his role as a global leader and trailblazer in medical science.</p>
</div></section></div><p></p>
